{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728 Step into Enchanted Crossroads \u2013 A Hidden Object Fantasy Adventure \ud83c\udff0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Enchanted Crossroads</i>, a magical town full of curious creatures, hidden treasures, and exciting secrets waiting to be found. Join Detective Greystone on thrilling missions as you search for clues, solve puzzles, and uncover the mysteries of a world touched by magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore beautifully  scenes filled with detail, where every corner hides a secret. Search for hidden objects, spot the differences, and enjoy a relaxing yet rewarding gameplay experience that blends brain-teasing puzzles with a rich visual style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1f Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun Variety of Tasks</strong> \u2013 Find hidden objects, spot the differences, and enjoy clever puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Collection</strong> \u2013 Complete quests, unlock rewards, and grow your magical trove.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Mystery to Unravel</strong> \u2013 Follow a charming story with colorful characters and twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Your Way</strong> \u2013 Use helpful hints and explore at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Growing World</strong> \u2013 Discover new allies and untold chapters in the world of <i>Magic of Runes</i>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude84 Adventure, mystery, and magic await in Enchanted Crossroads. Are you ready to begin the search?</strong></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beginner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2712750/e60434472d29cf1c9a97db7c5868afd3c3cb2e2d.jpg"},{"name":"Winner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/27